Subject: [PATCH] Settings: add Meizu HiFi Sound controls

Expose the PRO 5 ES9018 controls under System's additional settings. Store
only policy in Settings.System; AudioService owns the privileged HAL updates.
Use automatic gain by default and warn before enabling line-out mode.
